{
  "bodyHash": "972ece997987167d",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">鐵爐<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yWGgGVF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>靈感來自 cpw 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Chests</a>&nbsp;模組，新增了多種不同等級的熔爐。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aTsri2PvSis?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>憑藉無與倫比的處理速度、可自訂配置的側面、支援煙燻與高爐的增益插件，以及更多實用特性，將熔煉效率發揮至極致。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你能夠打造彩虹熔爐並解鎖其強大的力量嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/237664/description_09f9eaf4-c6c9-46bf-8ab3-de8890723606.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"283\" height=\"267\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>有任何問題嗎？請閱讀 <a href=\"https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnaces/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">版本狀態</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>NeoForge 26.x.x：持續開發中</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge：未開發中</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric：未開發中</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>舊版 Fabric：</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Furnaces [FABRIC]</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Iron Furnaces 應能與大多數模組相容。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>它已明確支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>&nbsp;與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-mmo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project MMO</a> 的相容性。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>推薦資源包：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Iron Furnaces Framed：[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-furnaces-bordered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252firon-furnaces-framed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>] 作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fEnleey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enleey</a><br>Shamble's Iron Furnaces：[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fshables-iron-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>] 作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fShable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shamble</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模組所使用的 Thermal Series 貼圖已獲得 CoFH 的授權同意。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>變更日誌</strong><strong>：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnacesNeoForge/blob/4.4.2/ifchangelog.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnacesNeoForge/blob/4.4.2/ifchangelog.txt</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">本模組為開源專案，採用 Apache License, Version 2.0 授權。在遵守授權條款的前提下，您可以修改並將其用於任何專案。</h3>",
